[0.661, "o", "  You're in a session: session-backfill-search-index-efac8749dd5e — \"Backfill search index\"\r\n    pd note \"progress\"     Log what you're doing\r\n    pd done \"summary\"      Wrap it up\r\n  \r\n  Get started:\r\n    pd setup                  [notify] Install daemon, MCP, FleetBar, init project\r\n    pd begin \"purpose\"       [notify] I'll set up your agent + session\r\n    pd done \"summary\"        [notify] Finish up — I'll clean everything\r\n    pd whoami                [silent] See your current context\r\n    pd attention             [notify] What other agents queued for you (run first thing!)\r\n  \r\n  Ports:\r\n    pd claim <id>            [notify] I'll assign a port  (c)\r\n    pd release <id>          [notify] Free it up  (r)  (--expired is destructive)\r\n    pd find [pattern]        [silent] What's running  (f, l, ps)\r\n  \r\n  Sessions & notes:\r\n    pd session start \"why\"   [notify] Manual session start\r\n"]
